name: Observatory — planet mult
author: corpus
description: >-
  Observatory makes Planet cards in your consumable area give X1.5 Mult for their specified
  poker hand. Tier-2 voucher: requires Telescope bought first, so the earliest practical
  target is Ante 2. RAG aliases: planet held Xmult, Perkeo Observatory, naneinf planet stack.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - voucher: Observatory
    antes: [2]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
should:
  - joker: Constellation
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - planetCard: Saturn
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - joker: Supernova
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
